    <string-array name="walkthrough_bodies">
        <item>A high-performance live TV lineup manager for your TV\'s built-in tuner. Fast zapping, custom channel numbering, and zero clutter.</item>
        <item>Press buttons on your remote now to test! Standard keys (CH±, Guide, OK, Recall) work immediately. If your remote has different buttons, you can customize keys anytime in Settings.</item>
        <item>Assign ANY channel number you prefer (1..9999). When you assign a number already in use, the two channels automatically swap without conflicts. Try clicking below!</item>
        <item>Star (★) your favorite channels to quickly view them in the [ ★ Favorites ] tab in the Guide. You can also hide channels you don\'t watch and restore them in Settings.</item>
        <item>Scan the QR code in Settings → Phone Setup from your phone browser on Wi-Fi to reorder channels, import/export backups, and edit names cleanly.</item>
        <item>Zero ads, no accounts, and 100% offline local playback. Press \'Get Started\' to begin watching!</item>
    </string-array>
